folder_remove_empty NEWS -- history of user-visible changes.

User-visible highlights per release. The full per-version log is in
`ChangeLog.md`.

* Version 1.0.20260927131905 (2026-09-27)

** The Python port begins

   folder_remove_empty is being rewritten in Python. This first release ships
   the packaging, the version identity and the `--version` entry point: the
   project installs with `pip install .` (one console script, a distribution
   version derived from the repository stamp), and the test skeleton plus the
   adapted repository scripts are in place. The engine and both front ends -
   the terminal mode and the tkinter window - follow.
